# camp: "Load game in progress" with fixtures/EOBDATA.SAV, then a click on the Camp button: the camp
# menu, which checks the far heap (the library's heapcheck, EOV1.C) before each of its menus.
option mouse
option save fixtures/EOBDATA.SAV
option insns 90000000
wait 600
key ENTER
wait 400
shot dungeon
mouse 300 185
wait 5
click 300 185
wait 100
shot camp
quit
